  "description": "💎 ORE BROS 💎 \n=\n#\nWe are recruiting!\n-\nLooking for active fighters ready to smash guild assaults and dominate battles!  \n#\nWe are a growing, battle-focused guild built for players who: \n- \n- 🔥 Want to push harder in Assaults  \n- ⚔️ Love battling, grinding, and climbing leaderboards  \n- 💰 Want a chill, helpful team without the drama  \n- 👊 Show up, hit hard, and have fun doing it\n#\nWhat we offer:\n-\n- ✨ Active members  \n- ✨ Consistent guild assault participation  \n- ✨ Support, tips, and resource sharing  \n- ✨ A team that actually plays\n#\nWhat we need from you:\n-\n- ⚒️ Be active  \n- ⚒️ Hit guild assaults  \n- ⚒️ Enjoy fighting and improving your build\n___\nIf you’re ready to join a guild that actually does stuff, then:  \n-\n👉 Join ORE BROS today!\n=\nDiscord:\n```\nhttps://discord.gg/RztNyNh6Ez\n```\n#\nLet’s mine, grind, and destroy our enemies together. 💪",
